# Compiled runtime output — never committed. Releases ship the .cpp
# sources and `hover --setup` builds this here with the user's own Zig
# (see runtimebuild.go); `make check-runtime` writes its CI check here too.
/runtime/build/

# Stray prebuilt libs from the old ship-a-binary-lib scheme. Linking one of
# these against a sim.o from a different toolchain is what produced the
# undefined std::__cxx11 symbols that motivated building from source.
/runtime/libhover_runtime.a
/runtime/hover_runtime.lib
